  "content": "<h1>解除詛咒附魔</h1><p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loaders-Fabric/Quilt/NeoForge-darkmagenta?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Versions-1.21.x_|_26.1.x_|_26.2.x-darkmagenta?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Environments-Server-darkmagenta?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></p><h3>如同移除其他附魔一般，使用砂輪就能將書籍和裝備上的詛咒去除！</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>能從任何裝備或附魔書上移除<code>綁定詛咒</code>和<code>消失詛咒</code></strong></li>\n<li><strong>解除詛咒時也會獲得經驗值，就像其他附魔一樣</strong></li>\n<li><strong>完全在伺服器端運作，亦可用於單人遊戲</strong></li>\n</ul><h4>如有任何問題或功能請求，請至<a href=\"https://github.com/CoolAid48/Disenchant-Curses/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>回報</h4><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcoolaid48\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"在Ko-fi上支持我\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/J2SGshKNah\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"在Discord上與我聊天\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/coolaid48\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"在Twitch上觀看我\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/social/twitch-singular_vector.svg\"></a></p><h2>正在尋找伺服器主機？</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8e85210a65b7c17998987c57b7571ba2fbd19bfb.png\" alt=\"伺服器託管合作夥伴\"></p>",
